# Persistence

## User entity

- Fields: `id` (Long), `firstName`, `lastName`, `email`, `password`, `role`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`
- Email: unique column constraint; store lowercase
- Role enum: `CUSTOMER`, `ADMIN`

## Repositories

- Prefer Spring Data derived queries (`findByEmail`, `existsByEmail`)
- Do not expose password fields through DTOs or API responses

## Schema

- Prefer JPA schema management for local/dev (`ddl-auto=update`) unless migrations are explicitly required
- Always keep a unique constraint on `email`
